4923a:d00\", \"start\": 323, \"end\": 500, \"text\": \"MBK Entertainment released a statement saying, “Jiyeon’s solo concept is sexy and will be similar to Park Jiyoon’s 'Coming of Age Ceremony\\\", but with a modern 2014-esque twist.”\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0099-638ef8f4923a:d00\", \"start\": 501, \"end\": 560, \"text\": \"On May 20, 2014 the extended play \\\"Never Ever\\\" was released\"}}, \"candidates\": [{\"candidate_id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Park Ji-yeon\", \"card_ids\": [\"ramdocs-0099-638ef8f4923a:d00:c0\"]}], \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0099-638ef8f4923a:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0099-638ef8f4923a:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"Never Ever EP\", \"claim\": \"Park Ji-yeon is the artist of the \\\"Never Ever\\\" EP.\", \"answer\": \"Park Ji-yeon\", \"quote\": \"Never Ever (Jiyeon EP) Never Ever is the debut EP by Park Ji-yeon.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"initial_answers\": [\"Park Ji-yeon\"]}"
